      "total_jobs": 169,
      "interpretation": "Repeats on one itinerary do not establish cross-task generalization or quality noninferiority; pilot results are not pooled into formal method differences"
    },
    "candidate_role": "exploratory; current short-history training does not establish effectiveness"
  },
